It is a bit more complex actually.

Recommended reading at <http://drblayney.com/Asclepius.html>.

I think this is a nice summing up:
"Friedlander [...] thinks the reason [for the prevalent use of the 
caduceaus in commercial aspects as opposed to the prevalent use of the 
asclepius in professional aspects] is that professional associations are 
more likely to have a real understanding of the two symbols, whereas 
commercial organizations are more likely to be concerned with the visual 
impact a symbol will have in selling their products."

